OL,3,GNEWSAArson arrest after blaze at
OL,4,Abungalow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Farson with intent to endanger life
OL,8,Fafter a fire at a bungalow in Worksop.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to the property in Rayton Spur
OL,12,Fon Thursday evening after firefighters
OL,13,Fsuspected the blaze had been started
OL,14,Fdeliberately.
OL,16,FThe bungalow, which was badly damaged
OL,17,Fby the fire, was unoccupied and no
OL,18,Finjuries were reported, the force
OL,19,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
